[2026-05-10T19:43:05.460Z] [INFO] {"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_480","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented and pushed the fix to PR 676: https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/pull/676\n\nWhat changed:\n- Resolved the merge conflict by bringing in latest `main`; PR merge state is now `CLEAN`.\n- Added `--auto-language` using `tinyld` with the requested >51% all-words rule for English/Russian issue/PR detection.\n- Kept hidden `--prompt-language` as an alias for explicit work-language override.\n- Localized `/limits` and Telegram `--show-limits` output for `en`, `ru`, `zh`, and `hi`.\n- Updated docs, changeset, tests, and the language-detection experiment.\n\nVerification:\n- Local checks passed, including `npm test`, `npm run lint`, `npm run format:check`, line-limit check, and focused new/localization tests.\n- First fresh CI run failed on Prettier for `experiments/test-language-detection.mjs`; I downloaded the log, fixed the experiment, pushed a follow-up commit.\n- Latest CI run passed: https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/actions/runs/25637952965\n- Working tree is clean."}}
