e didn't fully covered translation of UI (in telegram, and in GitHub comments, that purely system wise).\r\n\r\nFor example:\r\n\r\n```\r\n📊 Лимиты использования\r\n\r\nCurrent time: May 9, 1:18am UTC\r\n\r\nCPU\r\n░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░│░░░░░░░░░ 0% used\r\n0/6 CPU cores used\r\n\r\nRAM\r\n▓▓░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░│░░░░░░░░░ 7% used\r\n0.8/11.7 GB used\r\n\r\nDisk space\r\n▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓░░░░░░░░░░░░│░░ 50% used\r\n48.1/95.8 GB used\r\n\r\nGitHub API\r\n░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░│░░░░░░░░░░░░░░ 0% used\r\n0/5000 requests\r\nResets in 59m (May 9, 2:18am UTC)\r\n\r\nClaude limits\r\nClaude authentication expired. Please use `/solve` or `/hive` commands to trigger re-authentication of Claude.\r\n\r\nCodex limits\r\nPlan: pro\r\nCodex 5 hour session\r\n░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░ 0% passed\r\n░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░│░░░░░░░░░ 0% used\r\nResets in 4h 59m (May 9, 6:18am UTC)\r\n\r\nCurrent week (all models)\r\n▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓░░░░░░░░░░░░░ 57% passed\r\n▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░│ 30% used\r\nResets in 2d 23h 54m (May 12, 1:12am UTC)\r\n\r\nAdditional Codex limits\r\nGPT-5.3-Codex-Spark: session 0%, week 0%\r\n\r\nCodex credits\r\n0 balance\r\n\r\nQueues\r\nclaude (pending: 0, processing: 0)\r\nagent (pending: 0, processing: 0)\r\ncodex (pending: 0, processing: 0)\r\nqwen (pending: 0, processing: 0)\r\ngemini (pending: 0, processing: 0)\r\n```\r\n\r\nWas not fully translated to russian for users that select russian language in Telegram. The same should be for /solve, /hive, /help and other commands, we need to ensure all our UI elements are fully translated in all supported languages: en, ru, zh, hi.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/comments/4416076849/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/comments/4416078219","html_url":"https://github.com