[2026-05-10T19:43:09.639Z] [STDOUT] ## Summary

- Add `--auto-language` to fetch issue/PR title/body, detect English/Russian word majorities with `tinyld`, and set the solve work language when no explicit `--work-language` or hidden prompt-language alias is provided.
- Localize `/limits` and Telegram `--show-limits` output across en/ru/zh/hi, including Codex/Claude blocks and start/end/delta snapshots.
- Add docs, changeset, and regression tests for language detection and localized limit displays.

## Tests

- `node tests/test-auto-language.mjs`
- `node experiments/test-language-detection.mjs`
- `node tests/limits-display.test.mjs`
- `node tests/telegram-show-limits.test.mjs`
- `node tests/test-docs-options-sync.mjs`
- `node tests/test-docs-language-sync.mjs`
